Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.1.3) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * vdi-setup and the templates write "activated": true (boolean); the
     edulution-ui group editor shows the legacy string "yes" as unchecked and
     would save false.
   * postinst restarts linuxmuster-api after an upgrade so the API loads the
     new library instead of mixing old and new modules (answered 500 on
     /v1/vdi/clones until restarted).
